@prefix : <http://example.org/odp/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

:Pattern a owl:Ontology .
:WaterQualityMonitoring a owl:Class .
:WaterQualityMonitoringEvent a owl:Class .
:WaterQualityMonitoringParticipant a owl:Class .
:Which a owl:Class .
:What a owl:Class .
:hasParticipant a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain :Pattern ; rdfs:range :WaterQualityMonitoringParticipant .
:hasTimestamp a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain :Pattern ; rdfs:range rdfs:Literal .

